articles.content_en:
Article 34 For an enforcement objection action instituted by the applicant, after trial, the People's Court shall handle it separately according to the following circumstances:
(1) Where the reasons are established, it shall adjudicate to change or add the respondent as the person subject to enforcement and bear corresponding liability, or adjudicate to change the scope of liability;
(2) Where the reasons are not established, it shall adjudicate to dismiss the claims.
